msgstr "运行以下脚本以执行 PD 混布的在线推理。"

msgid ""
"- `--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length - that is, the sum of input and output tokens for a single request. Adjust it according to your actual scenario.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes more activation memory.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, while `--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. Configure them together according to the deployment topology and available NPUs.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer.\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To enable it, remove this option.\n"
"- `--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4k prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model.\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` enables 4-bit TurboQuant quantization for DeepSeek-V4's Compress-4 attention KV cache to reduce memory usage. It is suited to ultra-long-context workloads such as AI coding, especially when KV cache memory limits concurrency. It is independent of weight and indexer cache quantization and requires compatible TurboQuant and fused attention operators. P/D disaggregated deployments are not currently supported.\n"
"- `--speculative-config` configures speculative decoding to accelerate inference. Use `mtp` for Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) and `dspark` for DSpark models. When using DSpark, `num_speculative_tokens` must be at least 5 (check the checkpoint's `config.json`).\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables full ACL graph execution in the decode phase to reduce scheduling latency.\n"
"- `--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. `enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, `enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, and `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for better MoE throughput.\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`: Controls the retention interval, in tokens, for prefix-cache checkpoints of hybrid attention layers. It is applicable to DeepSeek-V4 and takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled. Under KV-cache pressure, it can improve the effective prefix-cache hit rate for reusable long prefixes. The value must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; for DeepSeek-V4-Flash, 128 times `--block-size` is recommended. Set it to `4096` when `--block-size` is `32`, or `16384` when `--block-size` is `128`."
msgstr ""
"- `--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度，即单个请求的输入与输出 token 之和。请根据实际场景进行调整。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` 表示每个 DP 组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，超出的请求将保持等待状态，不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所花费的时间也会计入 TTFT 和 TPOT 等指标。因此，在测试性能时，通常建议 `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= 实际总并发数。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高 prefill 效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size` 设置全局数据并行 rank 数，而 `--tensor-parallel-size` 设置每个 DP rank 内的张量并行大小。请根据部署拓扑和可用 NPU 一起配置它们。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。请勿在同一 MoE 层中混用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。如需启用，请移除此选项。\n"
"- `--block-size` 设置 KV cache 块大小。如需启用实验性的 4k 前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从 `128` 改为 `32`。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` 为 W8A8 模型启用昇腾量化。\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` 为 DeepSeek-V4 的 Compress-4 注意力 KV cache 启用 4 位 TurboQuant 量化，以减少内存占用。它适用于 AI 编码等超长上下文工作负载，尤其是当 KV cache 内存限制并发数时。它独立于权重和 indexer cache 量化，并且需要兼容的 TurboQuant 和融合注意力算子。目前不支持 P/D 分离部署。\n"
"- `--speculative-config` 配置投机解码以加速推理。对于多 token 预测（MTP）使用 `mtp`，对于 DSpark 模型使用 `dspark`。使用 DSpark 时，`num_speculative_tokens` 必须至少为 5（请查看 checkpoint 的 `config.json`）。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 在 decode 阶段启用完整的 ACL graph 执行，以降低调度延迟。\n"
"- `--additional-config` 启用昇腾特有的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL graph 执行，`enable_static_kernel: false` 保持静态 kernel 编译禁用，`enable_cpu_binding` 启用昇腾原生 CPU 绑核，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算以获得更好的 MoE 吞吐量。\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`：控制混合注意力层前缀缓存检查点的保留间隔（以 token 为单位）。它适用于 DeepSeek-V4，并且仅在启用前缀缓存时生效。在 KV cache 压力下，它可以提高可复用长前缀的有效前缀缓存命中率。该值必须是非负的 `--block-size` 倍数；对于 DeepSeek-V4-Flash，建议为 `--block-size` 的 128 倍。当 `--block-size` 为 `32` 时将其设置为 `4096`，当 `--block-size` 为 `128` 时将其设置为 `16384`。"

msgid ""
"Service Verification:\n"
"Use the API port configured for the selected deployment. For the 950DT example, use port `8000`."
msgstr ""
"服务验证：\n"
"使用为所选部署配置的 API 端口。对于 950DT 示例，请使用端口 `8000`。"

msgid "### 5.2 PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"PD (Prefill-Decode) separation addresses these issues by running Prefill and"
" Decode on dedicated NPU groups, each configured independently, on one or "
"more nodes. This architecture is recommended for production deployments with"
" concurrent multi-user workloads, where stable latency and high throughput "
"are both required."
msgstr ""
"PD（Prefill-Decode）分离通过在一个或多个节点上，将 Prefill 和 Decode 运行在各自独立配置的专用 NPU "
"组上，来解决这些问题。对于需要同时满足稳定延迟和高吞吐量的并发多用户工作负载的生产部署，推荐采用此架构。"

msgid ""
"The following sections describe multi-node PD separation deployment on Atlas"
" 800I A3 (128GB × 8) and Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8), and single-node PD "
"separation on 950DT products (96GB × 8)."
msgstr ""
"以下各节介绍在 Atlas 800I A3（128GB × 8）和 Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）上的多节点 PD 分离部署，以及在 "
"Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）上的单节点 PD 分离部署。"

msgid ""
"This section describes PD separation on a single 950DT products node (96GB ×"
" 8). The Prefill instance uses DP1/TP1 with PCP4 on NPUs 0–3, while the "
"Decode instances use DP4/TP1 with PCP1 on NPUs 4–7. KV Cache is transferred "
"from Prefill to Decode using MooncakeConnectorV2."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍在单个 Ascend 950DT系列产品节点（96GB × 8）上的 PD 分离部署。Prefill 实例在 NPU 0–3 上使用 "
"DP1/TP1 和 PCP4，而 Decode 实例在 NPU 4–7 上使用 DP4/TP1 和 PCP1。KV Cache 通过 "
"MooncakeConnectorV2 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode。"

msgid ""
"You can adjust the Prefill and Decode parallelism according to your workload"
" and service requirements. The prefill and decode parallelism settings in "
"--kv-transfer-config must match the actual engine configurations."
msgstr ""
"您可以根据工作负载和服务需求调整 Prefill 和 Decode 的并行度。--kv-transfer-config 中的 prefill 和 "
"decode 并行度设置必须与实际引擎配置相匹配。"

msgid ""
"Before starting the services, set VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 in both "
"templates to enable Model Runner V2. Replace nic_name, local_ip, and the "
"model path with the appropriate values for your environment."
msgstr ""
"在启动服务之前，请在两个模板中设置 VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 以启用 Model Runner V2。请将 "
"nic_name、local_ip 和模型路径替换为适合您环境的值。"

msgid ""
"Both Prefill and Decode use the same node IP (`<node_ip>`). The Prefill DP "
"group uses RPC port `12321`, while the Decode DP group uses RPC port "
"`12325`."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 和 Decode 使用相同的节点 IP（`<node_ip>`）。Prefill DP 组使用 RPC 端口 `12321`，而 "
"Decode DP 组使用 RPC 端口 `12325`。"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare one shared `launch_online_dp.py` launcher for Prefill and Decode."
msgstr "1. 为 Prefill 和 Decode 准备一个共享的 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器。"

msgid ""
"Select the startup script with `--script`. When `--dp-size` is `1`, the "
"launcher filters DP rank and external/hybrid load-balancing flags before "
"running the script. It also propagates pipeline failures through `pipefail`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `--script` 选择启动脚本。当 `--dp-size` 为 `1` 时，启动器会在运行脚本前过滤 DP rank "
"以及外部/混合负载均衡相关参数。它还会通过 `pipefail` 传播流水线故障。"

msgid "| Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 类型 | 必填 | 默认值 | 说明 |"

msgid "2. Prepare the P/D startup scripts."
msgstr "2. 准备 P/D 启动脚本。"

msgid ""
"Save the following templates as `run_prefill.sh` and `run_decode.sh` in the "
"same directory as `launch_online_dp.py`. If you use different filenames or "
"directories, pass their paths through `--script`; no launcher changes are "
"required."
msgstr ""
"将以下模板保存为 `run_prefill.sh` 和 `run_decode.sh`，放在与 `launch_online_dp.py` "
"相同的目录下。如果使用不同的文件名或目录，请通过 `--script` 传入其路径；无需修改启动器。"

msgid "1. Prefill script: `run_prefill.sh`"
msgstr "1. Prefill 脚本：`run_prefill.sh`"

msgid "2. Decode script: `run_decode.sh`"
msgstr "2. Decode 脚本：`run_decode.sh`"

msgid "3. Start the services."
msgstr "3. 启动服务。"

msgid ""
"Open separate terminals in the same container and run the commands from the "
"directory containing `launch_online_dp.py` and the startup scripts. Start "
"Prefill and Decode in separate terminals. The startup sequence is Prefill "
"and Decode → Proxy. Both roles use the same node IP but different DP RPC "
"ports."
msgstr ""
"在同一容器中打开多个终端，并在包含 `launch_online_dp.py` 和启动脚本的目录下运行命令。请在不同终端中分别启动 Prefill 和 "
"Decode。启动顺序为 Prefill 和 Decode → Proxy。两种角色使用相同的节点 IP，但使用不同的 DP RPC 端口。"

msgid "- Decode (NPUs 4–7)"
msgstr "- Decode（NPU 4–7）"

msgid "- Prefill (NPUs 0–3)"
msgstr "- Prefill（NPU 0–3）"

msgid ""
"Use `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w8a8` on four Atlas 800I A2 servers (8 NPUs per "
"server). Choose the workload settings from the table before starting either "
"role. The settings below retain the configurations selected in completed A2 "
"measurements; they are starting points for the listed workloads, not a "
"universal optimum across workloads or software versions."
msgstr ""
"在四台 Atlas 800I A2 服务器上使用 `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w8a8`（每台服务器 8 个 "
"NPU）。在启动任一角色之前，请从表中选择工作负载设置。以下设置保留了已完成的 A2 "
"测量中所选用的配置；它们是所列工作负载的起点，并非适用于所有工作负载或软件版本的通用最优值。"

msgid "| Role | Nodes / NPUs | Parallelism | HTTP endpoints |"
msgstr "| 角色 | 节点 / NPU | 并行度 | HTTP 端点 |"

msgid ""
"**Choose the server settings and client load.** D uses `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens 720` and `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.97` in every configuration. P "
"uses `--max-num-seqs 16`, `--api-server-count 4`, `--gpu-memory-utilization "
"0.96` and draft5/eager."
msgstr ""
"**选择服务器设置和客户端负载。** 在所有配置中，D 使用 `--max-num-batched-tokens 720` 和 `--gpu-"
"memory-utilization 0.97`。P 使用 `--max-num-seqs 16`、`--api-server-count "
"4`、`--gpu-memory-utilization 0.96` 以及 draft5/eager。"

msgid ""
"| Configuration | Workload / native window | P token budget / prefix cache |"
" D draft / max-num-seqs | Proxy workers |"
msgstr ""
"| 配置 | 工作负载 / 原生窗口 | P token 预算 / 前缀缓存 | D draft / max-num-seqs | 代理 worker "
"数 |"

msgid ""
"The recorded client loads below are separate from the server profiles. Input"
" counts include the measured client's 84-token template offset for these "
"ordinary-length cases. Keep the payload definition and tokenizer unchanged "
"when comparing them."
msgstr ""
"以下记录的客户端负载与服务器配置相互独立。对于这些普通长度场景，输入计数包含所测客户端 84 token "
"的模板偏移量。比较时请保持负载定义和分词器不变。"

msgid ""
"| Profile / window | Measured input / output tokens | Requests / concurrency"
" / rate (req/s) |"
msgstr "| 配置 / 窗口 | 实测输入 / 输出 token 数 | 请求数 / 并发数 / 速率（req/s） |"

msgid ""
"The measured context budgets are intentionally asymmetric: `--max-model-len "
"150000` on P and `508576` on D. The larger D budget does not extend the "
"prompt length that P can prefill. All ordinary-length workloads listed here "
"fit within the P budget; do not advertise the D value as the end-to-end "
"prompt limit. If a deployment requires equal P/D limits, change both to the "
"chosen service limit and revalidate KV capacity and throughput before "
"reusing these measurements."
msgstr ""
"实测的上下文预算是有意设置为非对称的：P 上为 `--max-model-len 150000`，D 上为 `508576`。更大的 D 预算并不会扩展"
" P 能够预填充的提示长度。此处列出的所有普通长度工作负载均处于 P 预算范围内；请勿将 D 的数值宣传为端到端提示长度上限。如果部署要求 P/D "
"限制相同，请将两者都改为选定的服务限制，并在复用这些测量结果之前重新验证 KV 容量和吞吐量。"

msgid ""
"Server configuration and client load must be recorded together. For the "
"16K/1K total-window latency trial, N8192/CC2048/rate0 was tested twice "
"against a current-deployment N8192/CC2304/rate0 control. The last repeat "
"reduced legacy TTFT mean/P90 from 21.30/50.32 seconds to 11.32/42.51 seconds"
" while output throughput changed by -0.54%. TPOT was 93.6 ms, not a 20 ms "
"SLO pass. This is a workload-specific result; lower concurrency does not "
"guarantee lower latency elsewhere. Do not substitute total results for "
"native stable results. The 1M cases require a separately validated long-"
"context deployment, not a larger `--max-model-len` in these scripts."
msgstr ""
"服务端配置与客户端负载必须一并记录。对于 16K/1K 总窗口时延试验，N8192/CC2048/rate0 测试了两次，并与当前部署的 "
"N8192/CC2304/rate0 对照组进行对比。最后一次重复测试将旧版 TTFT 均值/P90 从 21.30/50.32 秒降至 "
"11.32/42.51 秒，同时输出吞吐量变化为 -0.54%。TPOT 为 93.6 ms，未达到 20 ms 的 SLO "
"要求。这是特定于该工作负载的结果；降低并发并不保证在其他场景下也能降低时延。不要用总结果替代原生稳定结果。1M "
"场景需要单独验证的长上下文部署，而不是在这些脚本中增大 `--max-model-len`。"

msgid ""
"**Prefill: run this complete script on each P node.** Set `p_rank=0` on node"
" A and `p_rank=1` on node B; keep `head_ip` pointing at P node A. Start both"
" ranks before waiting for readiness."
msgstr ""
"**Prefill：在每个 P 节点上运行此完整脚本。** 在节点 A 上设置 `p_rank=0`，在节点 B 上设置 `p_rank=1`；保持 "
"`head_ip` 指向 P 节点 A。在等待就绪之前启动两个 rank。"

msgid ""
"**Decode: run this complete script on each D node.** Set `rank_offset=0` on "
"node A and `rank_offset=8` on node B; keep `head_ip` pointing at D node A. "
"Launch all ranks before waiting for readiness."
msgstr ""
"**Decode：在每个 D 节点上运行此完整脚本。** 在节点 A 上设置 `rank_offset=0`，在节点 B 上设置 "
"`rank_offset=8`；保持 `head_ip` 指向 D 节点 A。在等待就绪之前启动所有 rank。"

msgid ""
"**Start the proxy after all endpoints are healthy.** From the repository "
"root, run the following complete command block. Use four workers for the "
"short/medium and pooling configurations, or one for the recorded long-input "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""
"**在所有端点健康后启动代理。** 从仓库根目录运行以下完整命令块。对于短/中等和池化配置使用四个 worker，对于记录的长输入配置使用一个 "
"worker："

msgid ""
"Verify `/healthcheck` reports two P and sixteen D endpoints and inspect the "
"proxy/worker file-descriptor limits. Use the same `ulimit -n 65536` on the "
"benchmark client. Both P endpoints must receive requests; their separate "
"APIs do not imply independent compute capacity, because expert/MC2 "
"collectives can span both DP groups. Measure aggregate P throughput in one "
"shared wall-clock window."
msgstr ""
"验证 `/healthcheck` 报告两个 P 端点和十六个 D 端点，并检查代理/worker 的文件描述符限制。在基准测试客户端上使用相同的 "
"`ulimit -n 65536`。两个 P 端点都必须接收请求；它们独立的 API 并不意味着独立的计算能力，因为 expert/MC2 "
"集合通信可能跨越两个 DP 组。在一个共享的挂钟时间窗口内测量 P 的聚合吞吐量。"

msgid ""
"P explicitly selects `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES` version 1.3 in the measured "
"image. Verify the actual transport engine on both roles when changing "
"images; an environment variable alone is not proof of matching engines. The "
"historical `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL` environment variable was "
"not read by that image and is omitted here. Check the resolved `--prefix-"
"cache-retention-interval` before changing retention; zero does not disable "
"all prefix reuse. D stays in graph mode for target and draft. Recheck "
"dispatch capacity, KV residency and throughput together when adjusting "
"budgets; a low KV usage gauge does not exclude other memory or compute "
"bottlenecks."
msgstr ""
"P 在实测镜像中显式选择 `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES` 版本 "
"1.3。更换镜像时，请验证两个角色上的实际传输引擎；仅凭环境变量不能证明引擎匹配。历史环境变量 "
"`VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL` 未被该镜像读取，因此在此省略。在更改保留策略之前，请检查解析后的 "
"`--prefix-cache-retention-interval`；零并不会禁用所有前缀复用。D 的 target 和 draft "
"均保持图模式。调整预算时，请同时重新检查调度容量、KV 驻留和吞吐量；较低的 KV 使用率指标并不能排除其他内存或计算瓶颈。"

msgid "| Backend | Preparation | Validation scope |"
msgstr "| 后端 | 准备 | 验证范围 |"

msgid ""
"**Mooncake: prepare the Store and SSD layer.** Follow the [Mooncake backend "
"prerequisites](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-"
"backend) and keep the client wheel, native libraries and master compatible. "
"The following is the measured configuration structure, with deployment "
"addresses and paths replaced. Save `mooncake.json` on all four nodes:"
msgstr ""
"**Mooncake：准备 Store 和 SSD 层。** 遵循 [Mooncake "
"后端前提条件](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-"
"backend)，并保持客户端 wheel、原生库和 master 兼容。以下是实测的配置结构，部署地址和路径已替换。在所有四个节点上保存 "
"`mooncake.json`："

msgid ""
"Use the same tenant and master endpoint on P and D. Create the SSD directory"
" on each host and ensure it is writable. Confirm the installed backend "
"assigns distinct worker storage paths; otherwise provide distinct paths per "
"worker. Independent services with overlapping global ranks must not claim "
"the same storage root. DRAM registration, local buffers and SSD capacity are"
" per client/rank budgets, not a total-node memory cap."
msgstr ""
"在 P 和 D 上使用相同的 tenant 和 master 端点。在每个主机上创建 SSD 目录并确保其可写。确认已安装的后端为各 worker "
"分配了不同的存储路径；否则为每个 worker 提供不同的路径。具有重叠全局 rank 的独立服务不得声明相同的存储根目录。DRAM 注册、本地缓冲区和"
" SSD 容量是按客户端/rank 计算的预算，而不是节点总内存上限。"

msgid ""
"Start one master before starting vLLM. These offload-on-eviction settings "
"follow the [SSD backend "
"guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-5-mooncakestore-"
"ssd-offload-embedded-real-client-mode); verify flag support in the installed"
" master:"
msgstr ""
