"端口。后续每个实例使用下一个端口。 |"

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager "
"enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the "
"service may OOM during startup."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 KV "
"Pool 部署需要此标志；否则，服务在启动时可能发生 OOM。"

msgid ""
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on Prefill nodes instead of graph"
" compilation."
msgstr "- `--enforce-eager` 强制 Prefill 节点使用 eager 执行，而非图编译。"

msgid ""
"- `--trust-remote-code` allows the model repository's custom code to be "
"loaded. Only use trusted model repositories."
msgstr "- `--trust-remote-code` 允许加载模型仓库的自定义代码。请仅使用可信的模型仓库。"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`: Keep this environment variable exported in "
"both the Prefill and Decode pooling scripts. PCP requires Model Runner V2, "
"which does not support DSA-CP. Therefore, do not set `enable_dsa_cp` in "
"`--additional-config`."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`：请在 Prefill 和 Decode 的池化脚本中都导出此环境变量。PCP 需要 "
"Model Runner V2，而它不支持 DSA-CP。因此，不要在 `--additional-config` 中设置 "
"`enable_dsa_cp`。"

msgid ""
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` configures prefill context parallelism "
"(PCP) on Model Runner V2 (MRv2), replacing the DSA-CP configuration used on "
"MRv1. Besides speeding up long-context prefill, enabling PCP also shards the"
" `o_proj` weights across the PCP group, providing partial tensor parallelism"
" even when `--tensor-parallel-size` is `1` and relieving memory pressure."
msgstr ""
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 在 Model Runner V2 (MRv2) 上配置 prefill "
"上下文并行 (PCP)，取代 MRv1 上使用的 DSA-CP 配置。启用 PCP 除了加速长上下文 prefill 外，还会在 PCP 组内分片 "
"`o_proj` 权重，即使 `--tensor-parallel-size` 为 `1` 也能提供部分张量并行，从而缓解内存压力。"

msgid ""
"- `--kv-transfer-config` configures KV cache transfer between the Prefill "
"producer and Decode consumer in PD separation."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 配置 PD 分离中 Prefill 生产者与 Decode 消费者之间的 KV cache 传输。"

msgid ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from Prefill to Decode in PD "
"separation. Configure Prefill with `kv_role: kv_producer` and Decode with "
"`kv_role: kv_consumer`, allowing Decode to reuse the KV cache computed by "
"Prefill for subsequent token generation."
msgstr ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在 PD 分离中将 KV cache 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode。将 Prefill "
"配置为 `kv_role: kv_producer`，将 Decode 配置为 `kv_role: kv_consumer`，使 Decode 能够复用"
" Prefill 计算出的 KV cache 进行后续 token 生成。"

msgid ""
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on "
"the Prefill and Decode sides, respectively."
msgstr ""
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须分别与 Prefill 侧和 Decode 侧实际的全局 DP 和 TP 布局相匹配。"

msgid ""
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true` enables the "
"recomputation scheduler. When the Decode node has insufficient KV cache "
"space, requests are sent to Prefill for KV cache recomputation. Enable it "
"only on PD Decode nodes; the legacy top-level key is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true` 启用重计算调度器。当 Decode 节点的 "
"KV cache 空间不足时，请求会被发送到 Prefill 进行 KV cache 重计算。仅在 PD Decode 节点上启用；旧版顶层键已弃用。"

msgid ""
"- `--speculative-config`: Prefill and Decode must use the same DSpark "
"`num_speculative_tokens` value. Use the value declared by the checkpoint; "
"this example uses `5`. The nested `enforce_eager` applies to DSpark draft "
"execution, while the top-level `--enforce-eager` keeps the Prefill target "
"model in eager mode."
msgstr ""
"- `--speculative-config`：Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同的 DSpark "
"`num_speculative_tokens` 值。请使用 checkpoint 声明的值；本示例使用 `5`。嵌套的 `enforce_eager`"
" 作用于 DSpark draft 执行，而顶层的 `--enforce-eager` 使 Prefill 目标模型保持 eager 模式。"

msgid ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` use "
"FP8 KV cache. The P and D sides must use the same KV data types so that the "
"transferred KV cache is directly reusable."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 和 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 使用 FP8 "
"KV cache。P 侧和 D 侧必须使用相同的 KV 数据类型，以便传输的 KV cache 可直接复用。"

msgid ""
"- `enable_fused_mc2: 0` disables the Fused MC2 fusion operator on Prefill; "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` overlaps shared-expert computation"
" with MoE communication instead, and `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` places "
"shared experts on DP ranks."
msgstr ""
"- `enable_fused_mc2: 0` 在 Prefill 上禁用 Fused MC2 "
"融合算子；`multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` 改为将 shared-expert 计算与 MoE "
"通信重叠，`enable_shared_expert_dp: true` 将 shared experts 放置在 DP rank 上。"

msgid ""
"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` enables the extended "
"NPU graph mode on Decode for graph compilation, while Prefill runs in eager "
"mode. `enable_static_kernel: false` uses dynamic-shape kernels instead of "
"static-shape kernels for ACL Graph execution."
msgstr ""
"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` 在 Decode 上启用扩展 NPU "
"图模式进行图编译，而 Prefill 以 eager 模式运行。`enable_static_kernel: false` 使用动态 shape "
"kernel 而非静态 shape kernel 进行 ACL Graph 执行。"

msgid ""
"- `combine_quant_mode: 4` forces the MoE MC2 combine stage on Decode nodes "
"to use FP8 (MXFP float8_e4m3) communication quantization."
msgstr ""
"- `combine_quant_mode: 4` 强制 Decode 节点上的 MoE MC2 combine 阶段使用 FP8 (MXFP "
"float8_e4m3) 通信量化。"

msgid ""
"#### A3 Series PD Separation Deployment {: #521-a3-series-pd-separation-"
"deployment }"
msgstr ""
"#### Atlas A3系列产品 PD 分离部署 {: #521-a3-series-pd-separation-deployment }"

