"        |`--tp-size`|int|No|1|Tensor parallel size within each DP rank.|"
msgstr "        |`--tp-size`|int|否|1|每个 DP rank 内的张量并行大小。|"

msgid ""
"        |`--pcp-size`|int|No|1|Prefill context parallel size within each DP "
"rank. Each rank uses `--tp-size` × `--pcp-size` devices.|"
msgstr ""
"        |`--pcp-size`|int|否|1|每个 DP rank 内的 Prefill 上下文并行大小。每个 rank 使用 "
"`--tp-size` × `--pcp-size` 个设备。|"

msgid ""
"        |`--dp-size-local`|int|No|(same as `--dp-size`)|Number of DP ranks "
"on the current node. If not set, defaults to `--dp-size`.|"
