msgstr "        |`--vllm-start-port`|int|否|9000|此节点上每个 vLLM 引擎实例的起始端口。|"

msgid "#### A3 Series PD Separation Deployment with DSpark"
msgstr "#### Atlas A3系列产品结合 DSpark 的 PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"#### A2 Series PD Separation Deployment {: #522-a2-series-pd-separation-"
"deployment }"
msgstr ""
"#### Atlas A2系列产品 PD 分离部署 {: #522-a2-series-pd-separation-deployment }"

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"    - `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` is not currently supported in P/D disaggregated deployments.\n"
"    - `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph compilation.\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`: Enables Model Runner V2. Set it with `export VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` on both DSpark nodes in the A3 example. PCP requires Model Runner V2; DSA-CP is unsupported with V2, so do not set `enable_dsa_cp` in `--additional-config`.\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on the prefill and decode sides.\n"
"    - `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. When the KV Cache of the decode node is insufficient, requests will be sent to the prefill node to recompute the KV Cache. In the PD separation scenario, enable this configuration only on decode nodes.\n"
"    - `speculative-config`: When DSpark is enabled, Prefill and Decode must use the same number of speculative tokens, and `num_speculative_tokens` must be at least 5 (check the checkpoint's `config.json`). For MTP, we recommend setting Prefill to 1 and Decode to the actual number of speculative tokens.\n"
"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector`: the KV transfer connector used for PD separation, transferring KV Cache between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
"    - `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`: enables data parallelism for shared experts, applicable to MoE models.\n"
"    - `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`: Controls the retention interval, in tokens, for prefix-cache checkpoints of hybrid attention layers. It is applicable to DeepSeek-V4 and takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled. Under KV-cache pressure, it can improve the effective prefix-cache hit rate for reusable long prefixes. The value must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; for DeepSeek-V4-Flash, 128 times `--block-size` is recommended. Set it to `4096` when `--block-size` is `32`, or `16384` when `--block-size` is `128`.\n"
"    - `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: Enables the fused MoE computation (MC2) optimization, which consolidates shared expert and routed expert computation into fused kernels to reduce launch overhead and improve MoE inference throughput.\n"
"    - `cudagraph_capture_sizes` (inside `--compilation-config`): Batch size tiers for ACL graph capture in Decode phase. vLLM pre-compiles graphs for these batch sizes to avoid runtime compilation overhead. In DSpark mode (`num_speculative_tokens=5`), each sequence processes 6 tokens per step (1 real + 5 speculative), so actual concurrency ≈ `batch_size / 6` (e.g., 360 → 60 concurrency). If unset, vLLM auto-captures on demand; set explicitly when concurrency patterns are predictable."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool 部署需要此标志；否则，服务可能在启动期间发生 OOM。\n"
"    - `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` 目前在 P/D 分离部署中不受支持。\n"
"    - `--enforce-eager` 在 prefill 节点上强制使用 eager 执行，而非图编译。\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`：启用 Model Runner V2。在 A3 示例中，在两个 DSpark 节点上通过 `export VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` 进行设置。PCP 需要 Model Runner V2；DSA-CP 在 V2 下不受支持，因此不要在 `--additional-config` 中设置 `enable_dsa_cp`。\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 prefill 侧和 decode 侧实际的全局 DP 和 TP 布局相匹配。\n"
"    - `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当 decode 节点的 KV Cache 不足时，请求将被发送到 prefill 节点以重计算 KV Cache。在 PD 分离场景中，仅在 decode 节点上启用此配置。\n"
"    - `speculative-config`：启用 DSpark 时，Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同数量的投机 token，且 `num_speculative_tokens` 必须至少为 5（请查看 checkpoint 的 `config.json`）。对于 MTP，我们建议将 Prefill 设置为 1，将 Decode 设置为实际的投机 token 数量。\n"
"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector`：用于 PD 分离的 KV 传输连接器，在 prefill 和 decode 节点之间传输 KV Cache。\n"
"    - `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`：启用共享专家的数据并行，适用于 MoE 模型。\n"
"    - `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`：控制混合注意力层前缀缓存检查点的保留间隔（以 token 为单位）。它适用于 DeepSeek-V4，且仅在启用前缀缓存时生效。在 KV cache 压力下，它可以提高可复用长前缀的有效前缀缓存命中率。该值必须是非负的 `--block-size` 倍数；对于 DeepSeek-V4-Flash，建议设置为 `--block-size` 的 128 倍。当 `--block-size` 为 `32` 时将其设置为 `4096`，当 `--block-size` 为 `128` 时将其设置为 `16384`。\n"
"    - `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用融合 MoE 计算（MC2）优化，该优化将共享专家和路由专家计算合并到融合内核中，以减少启动开销并提高 MoE 推理吞吐量。\n"
"    - `cudagraph_capture_sizes`（位于 `--compilation-config` 内）：Decode 阶段 ACL 图捕获的批大小层级。vLLM 会为这些批大小预编译图，以避免运行时编译开销。在 DSpark 模式（`num_speculative_tokens=5`）下，每个序列每步处理 6 个 token（1 个真实 + 5 个投机），因此实际并发数 ≈ `batch_size / 6`（例如，360 → 60 并发）。如果未设置，vLLM 会按需自动捕获；当并发模式可预测时，请显式设置。"

msgid ""
"##### Ultra-Long Sequence Deployment {: #523-ultra-long-sequence-deployment "
"}"
msgstr "##### 超长序列部署 {: #523-ultra-long-sequence-deployment }"

msgid "=== \"A2 series with DSpark\""
msgstr "=== \"A2系列产品搭配 DSpark\""

msgid ""
"#### A2 Series PD Separation Deployment with DSpark (2P2D, 32 cards) {: "
"#525-a2-series-pd-separation-deployment-with-dspark-2p2d-32-cards }"
msgstr ""
"#### Atlas A2系列产品搭配 DSpark 的 PD 分离部署（2P2D，32 卡） {: #525-a2-series-pd-"
"separation-deployment-with-dspark-2p2d-32-cards }"

msgid ""
"!!! note \"Measurement and version scope\"\n"
"        The measured setup used the A2 `dev-26.2.0.day20261021` image, MRv2, P eager and D target/draft graph mode. It also included runtime changes for UVA dirty tracking, exact request-hash reuse and RoPE capacity; those changes are not delivered by this documentation update. Pin the image, model and loaded code when reproducing measurements. Revalidate these settings on a different build, including the `nightly-main` A2 image described in Section 4.1."
msgstr ""
"!!! note \"测量与版本范围\"\n"
"        测量所用的环境使用了 A2 `dev-26.2.0.day20261021` 镜像、MRv2、P eager 以及 D target/draft 图模式。它还包含针对 UVA 脏页跟踪、精确请求哈希复用和 RoPE 容量的运行时变更；这些变更并未包含在本次文档更新中。复现测量结果时，请固定镜像、模型和已加载的代码。在其他构建上重新验证这些设置，包括第 4.1 节中描述的 `nightly-main` A2 镜像。"

msgid ""
"!!! warning \"Topology and dispatch limits\"\n"
"        Keep `PP1 × PCP8` with `MooncakeHybridConnector`. The validated implementation rejects simultaneous PP>1 and PCP>1. Its A2 dispatch path also requires `D max-num-seqs × (1 + draft tokens) <= 256`: the measured pairs are 5/42, 2/85 and 1/128. A different draft length changes the legal request capacity; 42 is not a universal maximum."
msgstr ""
"!!! warning \"拓扑与调度限制\"\n"
"        使用 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 时保持 `PP1 × PCP8`。经验证的实现会拒绝同时使用 PP>1 和 PCP>1。其 A2 调度路径还要求 `D max-num-seqs × (1 + draft tokens) <= 256`：测量得到的配对为 5/42、2/85 和 1/128。不同的 draft 长度会改变合法的请求容量；42 并非通用的最大值。"

msgid ""
"### 5.3 KV Cache Pool Deployment {: #53-memcache-kv-cache-pool-deployment }"
msgstr "### 5.3 KV Cache Pool 部署 {: #53-memcache-kv-cache-pool-deployment }"

msgid ""
"This section provides PD separation deployment examples with a KV Cache Pool"
" for cross-engine KV cache reuse. The 950DT and A3 examples use the MemCache"
" backend, while the A2 examples cover both Mooncake and MemCache. Each "
"hardware tab describes backend and storage configuration, Prefill and Decode"
" startup steps, and KV cache reuse verification."
msgstr ""
"本节提供使用 KV Cache Pool 进行跨引擎 KV cache 复用的 PD 分离部署示例。950DT 和 A3 示例使用 MemCache "
"后端，而 A2 示例涵盖 Mooncake 和 MemCache 两种后端。每个硬件标签页描述了后端和存储配置、Prefill 和 Decode "
"启动步骤以及 KV cache 复用验证。"

msgid ""
"#### 950DT Single-Node PD Separation Deployment with Memcache KV Cache Pool "
"{: #54-950dt-single-node-pd-separation-deployment }"
msgstr ""
"#### Ascend 950DT系列产品使用 Memcache KV Cache Pool 的单节点 PD 分离部署 {: #54-950dt-"
"single-node-pd-separation-deployment }"

msgid ""
"This section extends [the 950DT PD deployment example](#524-950dt-series-pd-"
"separation-deployment) with a Memcache-backed KV Cache Pool on a single "
"950DT products node. Prefill uses NPUs `0,1,2,3`, while Decode uses NPUs "
"`4,5,6,7`. The existing external DP load balancing, API ports, DP RPC ports,"
" and proxy configuration remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"本节在[950DT PD 部署示例](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment)的基础上，在单个 "
"Ascend 950DT系列产品节点上增加了由 Memcache 支持的 KV Cache Pool。Prefill 使用 NPU "
"`0,1,2,3`，而 Decode 使用 NPU `4,5,6,7`。现有的外部 DP 负载均衡、API 端口、DP RPC 端口和代理配置保持不变。"

msgid ""
"Reuse the shared `launch_online_dp.py` from [the 950DT PD deployment "
"example](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment). Save the pooled "
"templates below as `run_prefill_memcache.sh` and `run_decode_memcache.sh`, "
"and select them with `--script`. These templates use `MultiConnector` and "
"the required Memcache environment variables."
msgstr ""
"复用[950DT PD 部署示例](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment)中的共享 "
"`launch_online_dp.py`。将下面的池化模板保存为 `run_prefill_memcache.sh` 和 "
"`run_decode_memcache.sh`，并通过 `--script` 选择它们。这些模板使用 `MultiConnector` 和所需的 "
"Memcache 环境变量。"

msgid ""
"1. <a id=\"5321-prerequisites-and-memcache-"
"configuration\"></a>**Prerequisites and MemCache Configuration**"
msgstr ""
"1. <a id=\"5321-prerequisites-and-memcache-configuration\"></a>**前提条件与 "
"MemCache 配置**"

msgid ""
"2. <a id=\"5322-prepare-the-prefill-startup-script\"></a>**Prepare the "
"Prefill Startup Script**"
msgstr ""
"2. <a id=\"5322-prepare-the-prefill-startup-script\"></a>**准备 Prefill 启动脚本**"

msgid ""
"3. <a id=\"5323-prepare-the-decode-startup-script\"></a>**Prepare the Decode"
" Startup Script**"
msgstr ""
"3. <a id=\"5323-prepare-the-decode-startup-script\"></a>**准备 Decode 启动脚本**"

msgid ""
"4. <a id=\"5324-startup-and-verification\"></a>**Startup and Verification**"
msgstr "4. <a id=\"5324-startup-and-verification\"></a>**启动与验证**"

msgid ""
"Wait until the Prefill API endpoint and all four Decode API endpoints are "
"healthy, then start the proxy using the configuration from [the 950DT PD "
"deployment example](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment). Send a "
"generation request to `<proxy_ip>:1999` as described in [Section "
"6](#6-functional-verification). Confirm that the response contains generated"
" text."
msgstr ""
"等待 Prefill API 端点以及全部四个 Decode API 端点均处于健康状态，然后使用 [950DT PD "
"部署示例](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment)中的配置启动代理。按照[第 6 "
"节](#6-functional-verification)所述，向 `<proxy_ip>:1999` 发送生成请求。确认响应中包含生成的文本。"

msgid ""
"- `AscendStoreConnector` integrates with the MemCache KV Cache Pool to "
"support external KV cache storage and reuse. In this example, Prefill "
"handles pool lookups, loading, and storage, while Decode receives KV cache "
"from Prefill."
msgstr ""
"- `AscendStoreConnector` 与 MemCache KV Cache Pool 集成，以支持外部 KV cache "
"存储与复用。在本示例中，Prefill 负责池查找、加载和存储，而 Decode 从 Prefill 接收 KV cache。"

msgid ""
"- `backend: \"memcache\"` selects MemCache as the pool storage backend. On "
"Prefill, `use_layerwise: true` enables layer-by-layer KV cache storage and "
"loading, while `layerwise_prefetch_layers: 3` configures prefetching to load"
" KV cache ahead of layer execution."
msgstr ""
"- `backend: \"memcache\"` 选择 MemCache 作为池存储后端。在 Prefill 上，`use_layerwise: "
