"        使用两个 Prefill 端点和全部十六个 Decode 端点启动代理："

msgid ""
"Pooling adds `AscendStoreConnector` to the Hybrid P-to-D transport through "
"`MultiConnector`. A PC90 or third-level-pooling scenario name does not "
"select a backend or prove that SSD offload is active. Select and prepare one"
" backend, then copy its complete P/D scripts below. They use P token "
"budget8192, P/D prefix caching enabled and D draft4/mns51/GMU0.97."
msgstr ""
"Pooling 通过 `MultiConnector` 将 `AscendStoreConnector` 添加到 Hybrid P-to-D "
"传输中。PC90 或三级池化场景名称并不会选择后端，也不能证明 SSD 卸载已生效。请选择并准备一个后端，然后复制下方该后端完整的 P/D "
"脚本。这些脚本使用 P token budget8192、P/D 前缀缓存开启以及 D draft4/mns51/GMU0.97。"

msgid ""
"Replace `<node0_ip>` and `<port>` with the IP address and port of the API "
"server for the single-node deployment in Section 5.1. For the PD separation "
"deployment in Section 5.2 or the KV Cache Pool deployment in Section 5.3, "
"use the proxy's IP address and port, since requests are routed through the "
"proxy to the Prefill and Decode instances."
msgstr ""
"对于 5.1 节中的单节点部署，请将 `<node0_ip>` 和 `<port>` 替换为 API 服务器的 IP 地址和端口。对于 5.2 节中的 "
"PD 分离部署或 5.3 节中的 KV Cache Pool 部署，请使用代理的 IP 地址和端口，因为请求会通过代理路由到 Prefill 和 "
"Decode 实例。"
